# ==============================================================================
# Global Redirects & Routing Rules for Netlify
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Force non-www to www (or vice-versa)
# Uncomment the line below if you want to force a specific domain canonicalization
# https://example.com https://www.example.com 301!

# 2. Force HTTPS (Netlify handles this automatically by default, 
# but you can explicitly enforce it or handle custom status codes if needed)
# http://* https://:splat 301!

# 3. Custom 404 Page Routing
# Zola generates a 404.html page. This tells Netlify to serve it cleanly 
# for any missing route without changing the browser URL to /404/
/*    /404.html    404

# 4. Example of a permanent manual redirect (301)
# /old-blog-path/*    /new-blog-path/:splat    301